(Because pure ripe banana powder contains naturally occurring fruit sugars without artificial anti-caking fillers, it is) Tj
T* (naturally hygroscopic. Store unopened containers in a clean, cool, dry, dark warehouse maintained below 25 C \(77 F\)) Tj
