(Commercial bulk formats include 25 kg sealed fiber drums with double food-grade polyethylene moisture-barrier liners) Tj
T* (and tamper-evident bands, as well as 20 kg / 25 kg multi-wall kraft bags or 5-ply corrugated cartons with internal) Tj
